<title>BRAZIL: Telemig posts Jan net of 26.0 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Telemig posts Jan net of 26.0 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian state-owned telecommunications firm Telecomunicacoes de Minas Gerais S.A. (Telemig) released the following unaudited, preliminary results for January 1997.</p>
<p>		    Jan 1997	    Jan 1996</p>
<p> Net		26.04 million	   N/A</p>
<p> Gross Revs    134.3 million	    N/A</p>
<p> Net Revs	102.7 million	    N/A</p>
<p>Note: All figures are in Brazilian reais. The company is a unit of the federal Telebras system serving Minas Gerais state.  </p>
<p>Comparative figures for January 1996 were not provided.</p>
<p>The company posted a net profit of 254.2 million reais in 1996 compared with a net profit of 76.9 million reais the prior year.</p>
<p>(--James Craig, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 248 5413)</p>
</text>
